{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490030/extras/bd2d4d38aa54fe6bade621774cd34a91.avif?t=1771932132\" width=800 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gods have turned their backs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your village stands alone, surrounded by the rising tide of mythological horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Forsaking Valhalla</i>, you lead a Norse settlement under siege. Build defenses, gather resources, train warriors, and hold the line against endless waves of enemies drawn from ancient legends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490030/extras/f60eddc16af5a806a4a0802877c09ad0.webp?t=1771932132\" width=759 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct walls, watchtowers, barricades, and traps to protect your Town Hall from attack.<br>Upgrade your defenses to withstand increasingly powerful waves. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every structure counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490030/extras/b73784b87874f2821101cc76bb025d39.webp?t=1771932132\" width=759 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit a variety of Viking units, each with unique strengths and battlefield roles.<br>Strategically expand your forces and adapt to evolving threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490030/extras/e2918400984b0d8faeae8463f1ef0c59.webp?t=1771932132\" width=759 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign villagers to gather essential resources\u2014wood, stone, and food.<br>Balance your economy carefully. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overbuilding can leave you exposed, while neglecting your defenses can mean disaster.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490030/extras/f8f9b287ade1f87912337ea9643ebb57.webp?t=1771932132\" width=759 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle creatures drawn from Norse mythology, including draugr, trolls, and giants.<br>Endure carefully designed waves of escalating difficulty, with endless challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490030/extras/09105750d726491e5b9ead06d32292c6.webp?t=1771932132\" width=742 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision carries weight. One misstep can mean the fall of your village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you survive the siege\u2014and will your people\u2019s story be one of triumph or ruin?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490030/extras/58ed5ccebb26dcbda8f5adabb89a899e.avif?t=1771932132\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490030/extras_big/58ed5ccebb26dcbda8f5adabb89a899e.avif?t=1771932132 width=800 height=503 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3490030?t=1771932132","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490030/96c11a26dcb1b214e98b55a5aae3c1dab48ca42a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771932132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490030/3fb9e464b4ef315d7d5f6c89c51cb844ce1e0563/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771932132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3490030/3fb9e464b4ef315d7d5f6c89c51cb844ce1e0563/ca